<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title><%= baseTitle %> <%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="/stylesheets/adminHub.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="/javascripts/formainPage.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="admin-hub-container">
        <header class="admin-hub-header">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                <h1>ITS-IMS</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="user-info">
                <span>관리자: <%= user ? user.name : '관리자' %></span>
                <a href="/users/logout" class="logout-btn"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> 로그아웃</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="admin-hub-content">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>시스템 관리</h2>
                <p>계정 추가를 제외한 모든 계정 수정 권한은 회장에게 있습니다.</p>
                <p>대부분의 기능은 관리자페이지에서 수행가능합니다.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="admin-hub-grid">
                <!-- 기본 기능 섹션 -->
                <div class="feature-section">
                    <div class="section-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> 기본 기능</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="button-container">
                        <button class="admin-btn primary-btn" onclick="location.href='/itemlist'">
                            <i class="fas fa-box-open"></i>
                            <span>아이템 대여소</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="admin-btn primary-btn" onclick="location.href='/admin'">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-cog"></i>
                            <span>관리자 페이지</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 로그 및 통계 섹션 -->
                <div class="feature-section">
                    <div class="section-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> 로그 및 통계</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="button-container">
                        <button class="admin-btn secondary-btn" onclick="location.href='/log'">
                            <i class="fas fa-book"></i>
                            <span>대여/반납 로그</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- 향후 확장 가능한 빈 섹션 -->
                <div class="feature-section expandable">
                    <div class="section-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-puzzle-piece"></i> 확장 기능</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="button-container">
                        <!-- 향후 버튼이 추가될 예정인 공간 -->
                        <div class="placeholder">
                            <i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i>
                            <span>새로운 기능 추가 가능, html등 작성으로 가능</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer class="admin-hub-footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> 물품 관리 시스템 - 관리자 허브</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>